      "answer": [
        { "given": ["Wet"], "make": false },
        { "given": ["Rain ∧ (Wind ∧ Wet)"], "goal": "Wind", "make": true }
      ],
      "intro": [
        {
          "t": {
            "zh": "板上这份声明不符合需求。请从引入和使用两个方向各写一条检验条例，找出它的错误。",
            "en": "The declaration on the board does not meet the requirement. Write a test case for each direction, introduction and use, to find its fault."
          }
        }
      ],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "需求：「下雨、刮风、地湿，三样都要」：三句都已证出才能引入。编写两条检验条例，使预期符合需求，这份声明的结果都和预期不符。",
        "en": "Requirement: “it rains, it is windy, the ground is wet: all three” may be introduced only when all three are proved. Write two test cases whose expectations meet the requirement and with which this declaration’s results both disagree."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "这份声明有几条引入规则？每条各要哪几样？",
          "en": "How many introduction rules does this declaration have, and what does each need?"
        },
        {
          "zh": "由它生成的消去规则分成几种情况？每种情况交还哪几句？",
          "en": "Into how many cases does the elimination rule made from it split, and what does each case hand back?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
