      "brief": {
        "zh": "需求：「今天是周六、周日，或者放假」：三句中证出任何一句就能引入。按照这份声明，在表中填出每条条例的目标是否可推导。",
        "en": "Requirement: “today is Saturday, Sunday, or a holiday” may be introduced once any one of the three is proved. Following this declaration, fill in whether each case’s goal is derivable."
