      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "要用「三选一」推出一句话，三种情况各自都要推得出它。",
          "en": "To derive a sentence from “one of three”, each of the three cases must derive it on its own."
        }
      ],
      "after": {
        "zh": "引入规则越多，引入越容易，使用越难：每多一条引入规则，消去时就多一种情况要处理。",
        "en": "The more introduction rules, the easier to introduce and the harder to use: each one more is one more case to handle when taking it apart."
